On Thursday 10 February 2011 20:30:26 .alyn.post. wrote:
> There are several compound cmavo in the BY selma'o, {.abu}, {.ebu},
> &c.  Is this the only selma'o which has words with pauses in them?

There are no words with pauses *in* them. There are some compound cmavo with 
pauses in them, but the pauses are between words, such as "na.e".

